# Docker reads .dockerignore from the build context root. Since the organizer
# image builds with the monorepo root as its context, this is the file that
# actually applies.

# Dependencies -- reinstalled inside the image from the pruned lockfile
**/node_modules

# Build output / caches
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.expo
**/dist
**/.output
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets -- these must never enter the build context
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.local.example

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
.github
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs and local-only tooling
**/*.log
README.md
LICENSE
**/plan.md
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
